# Working media. Regenerate with ./build-slots.sh (needs media/) and ./build-vo.sh.
# slots/ is all-intra H.264 for frame-exact seeking, which puts it past GitHub's
# 100 MB file limit -- it is a build product, not a source.
slots/
render.log
snapshots/
frame-*.png

# The render itself goes to YouTube, not into the repo.
patiently-demo.mp4

# Discarded voice takes. Only the two that make up line 03 (03d + 03h) are kept.
audio/vo/03[abcefg].wav

# Render scratch. hyperframes writes these next to the composition.
work-*/

# Thumbnail intermediates. The deliverables (thumb/cand-*.png|jpg) and their
# sources (thumb/gen/, thumb/dialog.png, build-thumb.py) are committed; the
# cand-*.html files just inline those as base64 and rebuild in a second.
thumb/_*
thumb/cand-*.html
thumb/gen/*.svg
